# Mnemo Cursor Rule

The canonical cross-agent instructions live in @AGENTS.md.

Before making non-trivial changes, read:
- @AGENTS.md
- @docs/project-status.md
- @docs/decisions.md
- @docs/architecture.md
- the current sprint spec referenced by project-status

Do not duplicate architecture rules in this Cursor-only file. If a durable project rule or architectural decision changes, update the shared repo documentation so Cursor, Codex, and future agents receive the same context.
